44697::$$$message_0388_0000_0000$$$::"I win! Now, be a good girl and get in my cage, Manaka...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=セイバーext face=驚き pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfangry layer=2] Hm? What the[line len=2]my body is being pulled back...!"::
44698::$$$message_0388_0000_0001$$$::"Ah, I see. There's nothing to keep us here since our summoner got knocked out. [wvl][hffacechg2 chara=キャスターext face=喜 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfpop layer=2]Ciao, little Sakura![humming]"::
44699::$$$message_0388_0000_0002$$$::"Thank god, we can finally go back to where we belong... [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=アーチャーext face=笑顔 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfsigh layer=2]Evil never prospers, Saber. Just give up on her."::
